---
description: Normalizes a structured Cisco ISE event to OCSF 1.9.
args:
  named:
    - name: timezone
      type: string
      default: null
      description: |
        The IANA time zone of syslog header times without offset. Only events
        without an own time need them, such as alarms. Defaults to UTC.
---

this = {event: this, ocsf: {}}
cisco::ise::ocsf::map event, ocsf, timezone=$timezone
this = ocsf
